    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$27,18,12,8$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a_4&=ar^3\\\\8&=27r^3\\\\r^3&=\\frac{8}{27}\\\\r&=\\frac{2}{3}\\end{align*}$$\nThe first four terms are $27,18,12,8$.",
